    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Coordinated Advance.</strong> Your commands snap people into motion.</p><ul><li>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack or you succeed on a key social check (such as an opposed roll in Parley), you can choose one ally who can see or hear you. That ally can immediately move up to half its speed as a reaction, without provoking reaction strikes from one creature of your choice.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times per Soma Break equal to your tier.</li></ul>",
